## Novel Insights
The paper’s strongest contribution is not any single model tweak but the recognition that **two-stage pipelines create “teacher-forced upstream / degraded-upstream-at-eval” mismatches** that can dominate downstream conclusions; however, to make OMMP-Bench a scientific control rather than just an alternate operating point, it needs **direct measurement of upstream map-error distributions** under the proposed split and a clearer separation between “map-range mismatch” and “added perception features” effects in the proposed baseline.

