**Assessment (no calibration available):** The reported quantitative gains are strong and the overall direction is meaningful, but two major issues—(i) the apparent **objective/claim misalignment** in the generative consistency loss (Sec. 3.2.3) and (ii) **missing clarity on how the learned point completion module is trained**—prevent the paper from convincingly supporting its core “hallucination mitigation + faithful scene completion” claims as written.

